---
// src/components/DddWardleyMappingDiagram.astro
---

<figure
  class="ddd-wardley-diagram"
  aria-labelledby="ddd-wardley-diagram-caption"
>
  <!-- 桌面版 SVG (寬度 960，高度 600，遵循 Anti-Quadrant，大字級、高對比、清爽透氣) -->
  <svg
    class="ddd-wardley-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 600"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="ddd-wardley-diagram-title ddd-wardley-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="ddd-wardley-diagram-title">
      Wardley Mapping 價值鏈演化與 DDD 核心域錨定全景
    </title>
    <desc id="ddd-wardley-diagram-desc">
      頂部展示雙軸維度（縱軸：使用者可見度價值鏈；橫軸：四階段演化成熟度）。主體四列展示
      Genesis 概念創生、Custom 自研深耕、Product 採購整合、Commodity
      雲端公用設施。底部展示資本錯配陷阱與系統分析架構防線。
    </desc>

    <!-- 頂部：戰略維度導覽欄 (高 52px) -->
    <g transform="translate(30, 20)">
      <rect
        width="900"
        height="52"
        rx="10"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__banner-bg"></rect>
      <circle cx="28" cy="26" r="7" fill="#d97706"></circle>
      <text x="46" y="32" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__banner-title"
        >瓦德利地圖雙軸分析：</text
      >
      <text x="215" y="32" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__banner-dim"
        >【縱軸】價值鏈可見度（User Need → Infrastructure）</text
      >
      <text x="595" y="32" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__banner-divider">|</text>
      <text x="615" y="32" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__banner-dim"
        >【橫軸】成熟演化階度（氣候規律推進）</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- 主體四列：演化四階段卡片 (單欄寬 213px，間距 16px，高 355px) -->

    <!-- 1. 創生期 Genesis (探索實驗) -->
    <g
      transform="translate(30, 92)"
      class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col ddd-wardley-diagram__col--genesis"
    >
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="355"
        rx="10"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--genesis"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="6"
        rx="3"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip--genesis"
      ></rect>

      <!-- Header -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 24)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag">PHASE 1 · 演化前端</text>
        <text y="25" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title">創生期 Genesis</text
        >
        <text y="46" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-subtitle"
          >未經證實 · 實驗性質原型</text
        >
      </g>

      <line
        x1="16"
        y1="84"
        x2="197"
        y2="84"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__divider"></line>

      <!-- Meta 區塊 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 98)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="68"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-box"></rect>
        <text x="12" y="22" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-label"
          >DDD 子域對應</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="42" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-val"
          >潛在核心域（孵化期）</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="58" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-sub"
          >市場不確定性極高，隨時 pivots</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 戰略要點 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 180)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__section-label"
          >系統分析特徵與原則</text
        >
        <text y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 市場極度未知，缺乏成熟標準</text
        >
        <text y="40" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 追求最快交付回饋與驗證</text
        >
        <text y="60" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 容忍技術債，拒絕過度設計</text
        >
        <text y="80" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 典型：未經驗證的 AI 商業模式</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 處置底標 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 290)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="48"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box--genesis"
        ></rect>
        <text x="12" y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-title"
          >戰略工程姿態</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="38" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-desc"
          >拋棄式原型 · 快速概念驗證</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- 2. 自建期 Custom-Built (核心域黃金戰場) -->
    <g
      transform="translate(259, 92)"
      class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col ddd-wardley-diagram__col--custom"
    >
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="355"
        rx="10"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--custom"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="6"
        rx="3"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip--custom"
      ></rect>

      <!-- Header -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 24)">
        <text
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag--gold"
          >PHASE 2 · 核心戰場</text
        >
        <text
          y="25"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title--gold"
          >自建期 Custom</text
        >
        <text y="46" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-subtitle"
          >商業壁壘 · 差異化護城河</text
        >
      </g>

      <line
        x1="16"
        y1="84"
        x2="197"
        y2="84"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__divider"></line>

      <!-- Meta 區塊 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 98)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="68"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-box ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-box--gold"
        ></rect>
        <text x="12" y="22" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-label"
          >DDD 子域對應</text
        >
        <text
          x="12"
          y="42"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-val ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-val--gold"
          >核心域（Core Domain）</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="58" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-sub"
          >開源即倒閉，不可替代壁壘</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 戰略要點 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 180)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__section-label"
          >系統分析特徵與原則</text
        >
        <text y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 業務價值最高，市場無直接競品</text
        >
        <text y="40" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 傾斜全公司最頂尖工程資源</text
        >
        <text y="60" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 建立深模組與純淨通用語言</text
        >
        <text y="80" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 典型：專利定價演算法、風控引擎</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 處置底標 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 290)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="48"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box--custom"
        ></rect>
        <text
          x="12"
          y="20"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-title ddd-wardley-diagram__action-title--gold"
          >戰略工程姿態</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="38" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-desc"
          >自主研發 · 100% 業務主權</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- 3. 產品期 Product (支撐與現成選型) -->
    <g
      transform="translate(488, 92)"
      class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col ddd-wardley-diagram__col--product"
    >
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="355"
        rx="10"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--product"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="6"
        rx="3"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip--product"
      ></rect>

      <!-- Header -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 24)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag">PHASE 3 · 成熟標準</text>
        <text y="25" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title">產品期 Product</text
        >
        <text y="46" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-subtitle"
          >市場充斥成熟 SaaS 與開源庫</text
        >
      </g>

      <line
        x1="16"
        y1="84"
        x2="197"
        y2="84"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__divider"></line>

      <!-- Meta 區塊 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 98)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="68"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-box"></rect>
        <text x="12" y="22" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-label"
          >DDD 子域對應</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="42" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-val"
          >支撐域 / 現成通用域</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="58" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-sub"
          >市場有標準，自己做不具優勢</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 戰略要點 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 180)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__section-label"
          >系統分析特徵與原則</text
        >
        <text y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 現成產品繁多，競爭激烈</text
        >
        <text y="40" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 優先「採購/整合」勝於自建</text
        >
        <text y="60" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 構建防腐層（ACL）隔離外部合約</text
        >
        <text y="80" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 典型：CRM、工單系統、CMS</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 處置底標 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 290)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="48"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box--product"
        ></rect>
        <text x="12" y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-title"
          >戰略工程姿態</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="38" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-desc"
          >採購整合 · 嚴禁盲目自幹</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- 4. 商品期 Commodity (通用基礎設施) -->
    <g
      transform="translate(717, 92)"
      class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col ddd-wardley-diagram__col--commodity"
    >
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="355"
        rx="10"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--commodity"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="213"
        height="6"
        rx="3"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip--commodity"
      ></rect>

      <!-- Header -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 24)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag">PHASE 4 · 演化終局</text>
        <text y="25" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title">商品期 Utility</text
        >
        <text y="46" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-subtitle"
          >水電公用化 · 高度標准化協議</text
        >
      </g>

      <line
        x1="16"
        y1="84"
        x2="197"
        y2="84"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__divider"></line>

      <!-- Meta 區塊 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 98)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="68"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-box"></rect>
        <text x="12" y="22" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-label"
          >DDD 子域對應</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="42" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-val"
          >通用子域（Generic Domain）</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="58" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__meta-sub"
          >高度同質化，自建即浪費資本</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 戰略要點 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 180)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__section-label"
          >系統分析特徵與原則</text
        >
        <text y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 按用量計費，極致可靠與標準</text
        >
        <text y="40" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 自建任何一行代碼都是負資產</text
        >
        <text y="60" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 隨插即用，直接呼叫雲端服務</text
        >
        <text y="80" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__bullet"
          >• 典型：AWS S3、Stripe、Auth0</text
        >
      </g>

      <!-- 處置底標 -->
      <g transform="translate(16, 290)">
        <rect
          width="181"
          height="48"
          rx="6"
          class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box--commodity"
        ></rect>
        <text x="12" y="20" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-title"
          >戰略工程姿態</text
        >
        <text x="12" y="38" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-desc"
          >公用設施 · 堅決直接訂閱</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- 底部：資本錯配警示與系統分析防線 (高 100px) -->
    <g transform="translate(30, 465)">
      <rect
        width="900"
        height="105"
        rx="10"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__warning-bg"></rect>
      <rect
        width="900"
        height="5"
        rx="2"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__warning-strip"></rect>

      <!-- 警示 Icon 與標題 -->
      <circle cx="36" cy="35" r="14" fill="#ef4444" opacity="0.15"></circle>
      <text
        x="36"
        y="41"
        text-anchor="middle"
        font-size="16"
        font-weight="900"
        fill="#ef4444">!</text
      >
      <text x="62" y="40" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__warning-title"
        >瓦德利演化氣候規律（Climatic Patterns）與系統分析資本防禦線</text
      >

      <!-- 警示內文兩欄排版 -->
      <g transform="translate(62, 54)">
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__warning-bullet" x="0" y="16">
          <tspan font-weight="700">演化不可逆性：</tspan> 所有組件都會受競爭壓力向右（Commodity）推移；當底層商品化時，高價值核心域必然向上層躍遷。
        </text>
        <text class="ddd-wardley-diagram__warning-bullet" x="0" y="36">
          <tspan font-weight="700">工程資本錯配：</tspan> 致命反模式是在 Commodity（如
          Auth、Message Queue）上自建專案，卻在 Custom（核心壁壘）上草率拼湊外包。
        </text>
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- 手機版 SVG (寬度 360，高度 1020，縱向堆疊卡片，字體 14px 起跳，極致清晰) -->
  <svg
    class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile"
    viewBox="0 0 360 1020"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="ddd-wardley-diagram-mobile-title ddd-wardley-diagram-mobile-desc"
  >
    <title id="ddd-wardley-diagram-mobile-title">
      Wardley Mapping 價值鏈演化與 DDD 核心域錨定全景（行動版）
    </title>
    <desc id="ddd-wardley-diagram-mobile-desc">
      瓦德利地圖演化四階段縱向卡片版：創生期原型、自建期核心域、產品期採購整合、商品期公用設施。
    </desc>

    <!-- 頂部：標題卡片 (高 70px) -->
    <g transform="translate(16, 16)">
      <rect
        width="328"
        height="66"
        rx="8"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__banner-bg"></rect>
      <text x="16" y="28" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-title"
        >瓦德利地圖 × DDD 系統分析</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="48" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-subtitle"
        >從價值鏈成熟度錨定不可替代核心域</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- 1. 創生期 Genesis (高 200px) -->
    <g transform="translate(16, 96)">
      <rect
        width="328"
        height="200"
        rx="8"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--genesis"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="328"
        height="5"
        rx="2"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip--genesis"
      ></rect>
      <text x="16" y="28" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag"
        >PHASE 1 · 演化前端</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="52" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title"
        >創生期 Genesis（探索驗證）</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="74" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-domain"
        >對應：潛在核心域（孵化中）</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="102" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-text"
        >• 特徵：市場不確定性極高，隨時 pivots</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="124" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-text"
        >• 姿態：拋棄式原型，容忍技術債，快速驗證</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="146" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-text"
        >• 典型：未經驗證之新創商業模式、AI 原型</text
      >
      <rect
        x="16"
        y="160"
        width="296"
        height="26"
        rx="4"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box--genesis"
      ></rect>
      <text x="24" y="177" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-action"
        >工程姿態：快速 Proof-of-Concept，拒過度設計</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- 2. 自建期 Custom (高 205px，黃金高亮) -->
    <g transform="translate(16, 310)">
      <rect
        width="328"
        height="205"
        rx="8"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--custom"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="328"
        height="5"
        rx="2"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip ddd-wardley-diagram__col-strip--custom"
      ></rect>
      <text
        x="16"
        y="28"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag ddd-wardley-diagram__phase-tag--gold"
        >PHASE 2 · 核心戰場（最高優先）</text
      >
      <text
        x="16"
        y="52"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title ddd-wardley-diagram__col-title--gold"
        >自建期 Custom（商業壁壘）</text
      >
      <text
        x="16"
        y="74"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-domain ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-domain--gold"
        >對應：DDD 核心域（Core Domain）</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="102" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-text"
        >• 特徵：開源即倒閉，全公司唯一競爭護城河</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="124" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-text"
        >• 姿態：投入頂尖菁英，精心封裝深模組與通用語言</text
      >
      <text x="16" y="146" class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-text"
        >• 典型：專利動態定價模型、即時撮合排程</text
      >
      <rect
        x="16"
        y="162"
        width="296"
        height="28"
        rx="4"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box ddd-wardley-diagram__action-box--custom"
      ></rect>
      <text
        x="24"
        y="180"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__mobile-action ddd-wardley-diagram__action-title--gold"
        >工程姿態：自主深度研發 · 100% 業務主權</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- 3. 產品期 Product (高 200px) -->
    <g transform="translate(16, 529)">
      <rect
        width="328"
        height="200"
        rx="8"
        class="ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card ddd-wardley-diagram__main-card--product"
      ></rect>
      <rect
        width="328"
